1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:01,980
Hello!

2
00:00:02,060 --> 00:00:09,454
Oi, amiguinho! Hoje a Tuti vai de foguete
até a Lua! Este é o meu amigo, o robô Bip.

3
00:00:09,534 --> 00:00:11,424
Hello! I am Bip!

4
00:00:11,574 --> 00:00:17,914
O foguete só decola se a gente contar até
dez em inglês. Você me ajuda? Vamos treinar!

5
00:00:19,767 --> 00:00:23,697
Primeiro, de um a cinco.
Olhe as estrelas!

6
00:00:23,867 --> 00:00:25,067
One...

7
00:00:25,197 --> 00:00:26,397
two...

8
00:00:26,567 --> 00:00:27,767
three...

9
00:00:27,897 --> 00:00:29,097
four...

10
00:00:29,207 --> 00:00:30,317
five!

11
00:00:30,397 --> 00:00:33,097
Agora você! Repita comigo:

12
00:00:33,237 --> 00:00:34,437
One...

13
00:00:34,567 --> 00:00:35,767
two...

14
00:00:35,937 --> 00:00:37,137
three...

15
00:00:37,267 --> 00:00:38,467
four...

16
00:00:38,577 --> 00:00:39,777
five!

17
00:00:39,867 --> 00:00:41,067
Very good!

18
00:00:42,933 --> 00:00:46,623
Agora com o corpo! Bata
palmas três vezes:

19
00:00:46,703 --> 00:00:47,813
clap three!

20
00:00:47,893 --> 00:00:48,983
One...

21
00:00:49,063 --> 00:00:50,163
two...

22
00:00:50,243 --> 00:00:51,163
three!

23
00:00:51,243 --> 00:00:52,983
Agora pule cinco vezes:

24
00:00:53,063 --> 00:00:54,593
jump five!

25
00:00:54,743 --> 00:00:55,943
One...

26
00:00:56,073 --> 00:00:57,273
two...

27
00:00:57,443 --> 00:00:58,643
three...

28
00:00:58,773 --> 00:00:59,973
four...

29
00:01:00,083 --> 00:01:01,283
five!

30
00:01:01,473 --> 00:01:02,523
Sua vez!

31
00:01:02,603 --> 00:01:03,803
Clap three!

32
00:01:06,753 --> 00:01:07,983
Jump five!

33
00:01:12,783 --> 00:01:13,983
Very good!

34
00:01:15,867 --> 00:01:18,757
Agora os números grandes, de seis a dez!

35
00:01:18,977 --> 00:01:20,107
Six...

36
00:01:20,187 --> 00:01:21,387
seven...

37
00:01:21,497 --> 00:01:22,497
eight...

38
00:01:22,577 --> 00:01:23,777
nine...

39
00:01:24,047 --> 00:01:25,247
ten!

40
00:01:25,347 --> 00:01:28,047
Agora você! Repita comigo:

41
00:01:28,187 --> 00:01:29,317
Six...

42
00:01:29,397 --> 00:01:30,597
seven...

43
00:01:30,707 --> 00:01:31,707
eight...

44
00:01:31,787 --> 00:01:32,987
nine...

45
00:01:33,257 --> 00:01:34,457
ten!

46
00:01:34,657 --> 00:01:36,987
Você já sabe contar até dez!

47
00:01:39,617 --> 00:01:41,477
Qual é o number four?

48
00:01:42,127 --> 00:01:43,327
O dois...

49
00:01:43,797 --> 00:01:44,997
o quatro...

50
00:01:45,607 --> 00:01:46,807
ou o sete?

51
00:01:58,657 --> 00:02:00,797
O quatro! Four!

52
00:02:01,147 --> 00:02:02,347
Muito bem!

53
00:02:04,733 --> 00:02:07,863
Quantas estrelas tem no
céu? Conte com calma!

54
00:02:18,813 --> 00:02:19,963
Vamos contar!

55
00:02:20,043 --> 00:02:21,203
One...

56
00:02:21,283 --> 00:02:22,483
two...

57
00:02:22,623 --> 00:02:23,683
three...

58
00:02:23,763 --> 00:02:24,863
four...

59
00:02:24,943 --> 00:02:26,113
five...

60
00:02:26,193 --> 00:02:27,213
six...

61
00:02:27,293 --> 00:02:28,493
seven!

62
00:02:29,363 --> 00:02:31,133
Seven estrelas!

63
00:02:33,633 --> 00:02:37,843
O Bip vai contar, mas vai
pular um número. Escute!

64
00:02:38,183 --> 00:02:39,383
One...

65
00:02:39,483 --> 00:02:40,663
two...

66
00:02:40,743 --> 00:02:41,943
four!

67
00:02:44,150 --> 00:02:45,550
Qual número faltou?

68
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:47,400
O três...

69
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:49,120
o cinco...

70
00:02:49,630 --> 00:02:50,830
ou o seis?

71
00:03:02,930 --> 00:03:05,070
O três! Three!

72
00:03:05,420 --> 00:03:07,210
Oops! Three!

73
00:03:10,083 --> 00:03:11,506
Olhe bem onde o ten

74
00:03:11,586 --> 00:03:12,786
está.

75
00:03:17,118 --> 00:03:19,068
As cartas trocaram de lugar!

76
00:03:19,318 --> 00:03:20,698
Onde está o dez?

77
00:03:21,248 --> 00:03:22,448
No um...

78
00:03:22,708 --> 00:03:23,908
no dois...

79
00:03:24,318 --> 00:03:25,518
ou no três?

80
00:03:37,538 --> 00:03:39,088
No número três!

81
00:03:39,438 --> 00:03:41,968
Ten! Você tem olho bom!

82
00:03:44,300 --> 00:03:49,810
Chegou a hora! Todos a bordo! Conte
comigo, de trás para a frente!

83
00:03:50,160 --> 00:03:51,360
Ten...

84
00:03:51,500 --> 00:03:52,700
nine...

85
00:03:52,980 --> 00:03:54,010
eight...

86
00:03:54,090 --> 00:03:55,290
seven...

87
00:03:55,550 --> 00:03:56,670
six...

88
00:03:56,750 --> 00:03:57,950
Five...

89
00:03:58,060 --> 00:03:59,260
four...

90
00:03:59,390 --> 00:04:00,590
three...

91
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:01,880
two...

92
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,100
one!

93
00:04:03,180 --> 00:04:04,380
Blast off!

94
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:14,680
Uhuuu! Chegamos à Lua! Você
contou até dez em inglês!

95
00:04:14,790 --> 00:04:17,170
Bye-bye! Tchau, amiguinho!
